    "question": "<figure class=\"madas-excerpt\"><img src=\"resources/madas/alevel-applied-d/q13-question-1.svg\" alt=\"ms− at an angle of elevation β . 1 A particle is projected from a point O with speed 36 It reaches a point P which is at the same vertical level as O and at a horizontal distance of 60 m from O . The particle is subject to no other external forces except its weight. ( ) a) Find the two possible values of β . 8 b) Determine the shortest possible flight time for the journey. ( ) 2\" style=\"--madas-width:574.7px\"></figure>",
    "steps": [
